    <h2>What the re-ranker looks at</h2>
    <p>LightGBM scores each of the 200 FAISS candidates using 15 features. It trains on 60,000 pseudo-labeled pairs from 240 seed queries. Takes under a second on CPU. The whole model is 585 KB. Validation R-squared is 0.999 on held-out queries, which honestly surprised me.</p>
