    <h3 class="hw-subtitle">Before and after genre mixing</h3>
    <p>The round-robin layer groups candidates by primary genre, sorts each group by LightGBM score, and interleaves them. It caps any genre at three appearances and reserves position 8 as a serendipity slot, because sometimes you want to be surprised.</p>
